# The per-opcode SPC program-counter histogram (a 512 KiB array touched on
# every SPC instruction) and the per-write port counters are read only by
# the TCP debug server, which exists in SNESRECOMP_TRACE builds alone.
# Keep them for those builds and drop the traffic from production.
@@ pc-histogram-trace-only
